{
  "id": "publish-post-retry",
  "title": "publishPost · a retried upload",
  "blurb": "publishPost reads a draft, renders it to HTML, and uploads it to S3. A bad-markdown failure from the render is caught and falls back to plain text, and the upload itself can fail once and succeed on retry.",
